OL,3,AGoogle Cloud says services are
OL,4,Arecovering after outage hit banks,
OL,5,Abusinesses, and courts
OL,6,
OL,7,FGoogle says only a "very small" number
OL,8,Fof customers are now affected after
OL,9,Fproblems with its Cloud service
OL,10,Faffected banks, other businesses, and
OL,11,Fcourts
OL,13,FRevolut, Halifax, HSBC, delivery
OL,14,Fservice DPD, and e-bike service Forest
OL,15,Fwere among the businesses affected
OL,17,FElsewhere, the courts service said its
OL,18,Fvideo links were affected - the
OL,19,FCriminal Bar Association said earlier
OL,20,Fthat prosecution and defence barristers
OL,21,Fin England and Wales could not "proceed
OL,22,Fwith trials and other hearings"
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
